# Cloudflare Pages 301s for legacy URLs.
#
# /photos/:slug used to serve a single photo page. Photos.exe was restructured
# to a 5-pattern hierarchy, so the canonical URL is now /photos/gallery/:slug.
# We keep the legacy path alive as a 301 so inbound links and old bookmarks
# don't 404.
/photos/:slug   /photos/gallery/:slug   301
